    "detailed_description": "Traders of Natac is a fresh realtime twist on a familiar hexagon board.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realtime Twist</h2>Play a full 4 player PvP game in 10 minutes. All of the depth with none of the down time. The action never stops when you don't have to wait on lengthy trade negotiations!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Market</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/4a25d6f032fcf1cff86ac6a0584a7b9c.poster.avif?t=1708461726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/4a25d6f032fcf1cff86ac6a0584a7b9c.webm?t=1708461726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/4a25d6f032fcf1cff86ac6a0584a7b9c.mp4?t=1708461726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Instead of trading, buy and sell from the same resource market as other players. While prices surge buying in at the right time yields large dividends. Keep market prices high to lock out your opponents or crash them to prevent profits from other players!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Generation</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/d96832b9dc95328cea2edf8e30f46a3a.poster.avif?t=1708461726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/d96832b9dc95328cea2edf8e30f46a3a.webm?t=1708461726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/d96832b9dc95328cea2edf8e30f46a3a.mp4?t=1708461726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>When every increment your settlements and cities collect resources, your fate is on your hands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realtime initial placement</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/42c9b25fe421d550e5b15ce5ad73cd48.poster.avif?t=1708461726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/42c9b25fe421d550e5b15ce5ad73cd48.webm?t=1708461726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/42c9b25fe421d550e5b15ce5ad73cd48.mp4?t=1708461726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Place early and take on debt which must be paid off to receive your full resource income. Place as early as your dare!",
    "about_the_game": "Traders of Natac is a fresh realtime twist on a familiar hexagon board.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realtime Twist</h2>Play a full 4 player PvP game in 10 minutes. All of the depth with none of the down time. The action never stops when you don't have to wait on lengthy trade negotiations!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Market</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/4a25d6f032fcf1cff86ac6a0584a7b9c.poster.avif?t=1708461726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/4a25d6f032fcf1cff86ac6a0584a7b9c.webm?t=1708461726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/4a25d6f032fcf1cff86ac6a0584a7b9c.mp4?t=1708461726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Instead of trading, buy and sell from the same resource market as other players. While prices surge buying in at the right time yields large dividends. Keep market prices high to lock out your opponents or crash them to prevent profits from other players!<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Resource Generation</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/d96832b9dc95328cea2edf8e30f46a3a.poster.avif?t=1708461726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/d96832b9dc95328cea2edf8e30f46a3a.webm?t=1708461726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/d96832b9dc95328cea2edf8e30f46a3a.mp4?t=1708461726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>When every increment your settlements and cities collect resources, your fate is on your hands.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Realtime initial placement</h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/42c9b25fe421d550e5b15ce5ad73cd48.poster.avif?t=1708461726\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/42c9b25fe421d550e5b15ce5ad73cd48.webm?t=1708461726\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2443350/extras/42c9b25fe421d550e5b15ce5ad73cd48.mp4?t=1708461726\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Place early and take on debt which must be paid off to receive your full resource income. Place as early as your dare!",
